WEEK 14 — SHARING RECEIPTS SECURELY

Date: Monday, 9 November 2026

Problem: A shared receipt link must open without signing in, but nobody guessing a bill ID may see someone else's bill.

Solution:
- Each receipt gets a token made with HMAC-SHA256 from the server secret.
- The server compares tokens in constant time, so the check cannot be timed.
- A valid token opens the receipt read-only; a forged token gets a not-found reply.
- Share, WhatsApp and Copy link use the Web Share API, with copy as the fallback.
- Tested that valid links open and forged links are refused.
